---
# TEMPLATE (.mdyt) — eSheet resolver: `fields:` map mirrors eSheet
# FieldDefinition/FieldResponse. Data-bearing (defaults double as a preview);
# applying a real FormResponse overrides these values.
mdy:
  kind: template
  engine: handlebars
  schema: esheet
  name: Vitals intake
  version: 1.0.0
fields:
  patient_name:
    fieldType: text
    question: Full Name
    required: true
    value: Jordan Rivera
  body_height:
    fieldType: text
    question: Height
    inputType: number
    unit: cm
    value: 180
    display: "5'11\""
  body_weight:
    fieldType: text
    question: Weight
    inputType: number
    unit: kg
    value: 89.8
    display: 198 lb
  smoker:
    fieldType: boolean
    question: Tobacco use?
    value: false
    display: "No"
---
# Vitals Intake

**{{fields.patient_name.question}}:** [{{fields.patient_name.value}}](#patient_name)

## Vitals

- {{fields.body_height.question}}: [{{fields.body_height.display}}](#body_height)
- {{fields.body_weight.question}}: [{{fields.body_weight.display}}](#body_weight)
- {{fields.smoker.question}} [{{fields.smoker.display}}](#smoker)
